# What `gcloud builds submit` uploads for the DASHBOARD SPA build.
#
# This directory is submitted as its own source root, for the same reason the
# backend is: the repository .gcloudignore excludes `AI-phone-dashboard`
# outright, so submitting from the root uploads nothing useful.
#
# THIS FILE MUST EXIST even though it is short. With no .gcloudignore in the
# source root gcloud falls back to .gitignore, which is written for a different
# purpose — that fallback is what let a 278 MiB / 705-file tarball through on
# the voice image's first submit, and this directory has a `Vetra-desktop`
# folder and a checked-in `dist` that would ride along for no reason.
.git
.gitignore
node_modules
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Built by the pipeline, never uploaded to it.
dist

# Test suites and their fixtures. The bundle ships none of them, and Vite does
# not compile them.
src/__tests__
coverage

# Design source, not application source.
Vetra-desktop

*.log
